IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tma-types`
IMPORT `tma-returns`
IMPORT `tma-payment`
IMPORT `tma-time-limits`

-- Taxes Management Act 1970 (UK) — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Self-assessment case` HAS
    `the return`                                        IS A `Return facts`
    `the payments`                                      IS A `Payment facts`
    `the loss of tax`                                   IS A `Loss of tax`

DECLARE `Self-assessment position` HAS
    `last day to notify chargeability`                  IS A DATE
    `filing deadline`                                   IS A MAYBE DATE
    `last day to amend the return`                      IS A DATE
    `last day for a notice of enquiry`                  IS A MAYBE DATE
    `payments on account due`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `each payment on account`                           IS A NUMBER
    `first payment on account date`                     IS A DATE
    `second payment on account date`                    IS A DATE
    `balancing payment`                                 IS A NUMBER
    `balancing payment date`                            IS A DATE
    `last day for an assessment`                        IS A DATE

@ref ss 7, 8, 9ZA, 9A, 34, 36, 36A, 59A, 59B
@export default An individual's self-assessment position for a tax year under the Taxes Management Act 1970 (UK): the last day to notify chargeability (s 7); the filing deadline (s 8); the last day to amend (s 9ZA); the last day for a notice of enquiry (s 9A); whether payments on account are due, each one's amount and dates (s 59A); the balancing payment and its date (s 59B); and the last day for an assessment (ss 34, 36, 36A). DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN c IS A `Self-assessment case`  @desc The return facts, the payment facts, and how any loss of tax was brought about
GIVETH A `Self-assessment position`
`the self-assessment position for` c MEANS
    `Self-assessment position` WITH
        `last day to notify chargeability`              IS `the last day to notify chargeability for` r
        `filing deadline`                               IS `the filing deadline for` r
        `last day to amend the return`                  IS `the last day to amend the return for` r
        `last day for a notice of enquiry`              IS `the last day for a notice of enquiry for` r
        `payments on account due`                       IS `payments on account are due under` p
        `each payment on account`                       IS `each payment on account under` p
        `first payment on account date`                 IS `the first payment on account date for` p
        `second payment on account date`                IS `the second payment on account date for` p
        `balancing payment`                             IS `the balancing payment under` p
        `balancing payment date`                        IS `the balancing payment date for` p
        `last day for an assessment`                    IS `the last day for an assessment for` (r's `tax year`) `where the loss is` (c's `the loss of tax`)
    WHERE
        r MEANS c's `the return`
        p MEANS c's `the payments`
